      "type": "registry:style",
      "title": "Dither theme",
      "description": "Retro tokens, phosphor and cyan-pixel palettes, dither, bevel and offset-shadow utilities.",
      "docs": "Load a pixel display font and a mono body font and expose them as --font-silkscreen and --font-vt323, for example with next/font/google Silkscreen and VT323. Set data-theme=\"phosphor\" or data-theme=\"cyan-pixel\" on <html>; add the dark class for the dark variant.",
